<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Dear [<span style="color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;background:yellow">Client</span>],<br><br></span></span></p><p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">As you become acclimated
to Insperity, I want to ensure that you are prepared for the various
communications that come from Insperity. During and after your tenure as a
client, Insperity will communicate with you in a variety of methods. Most
frequently communications will originate from me; you may occasionally receive
emails from Insperity corporate partners as well as important emails that are
distributed through our automated email platform. The emails that come through
our automated platform will be delivered with the sender address
“@response.insperity.com”. To ensure these important emails are received, you
will want to whitelist this email address. I have attached a job aid that
illustrates how to whitelist that email domain.<br><br></span></p><p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun" style="font-size: 12pt;">Please reach out
to me directly with questions after receipt of an email from a corporate
partner to avoid delay in my response as the @response.insperity.com email
address is not monitored. I recommend that if the email is styled from me with
this domain, that you remove the “response.” section of the email domain to
ensure accurate delivery.</span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin">Thank you for
allowing Insperity to serve your business.</span></span></p>

<p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow"><br></span></span></p><p class="paragraph" style="margin:0in;vertical-align:baseline"><span class="normaltextrun"><span style="mso-ascii-font-family:Calibri;mso-ascii-theme-font:
minor-latin;mso-hansi-font-family:Calibri;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;
mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin;background:yellow;
mso-highlight:yellow">[signature]<br><br></span></span></p>]]></td>
</tr>
